ist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuiyus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuiyus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuiyus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuiyus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuiyus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuiyus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-05-12T09:32:50Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T12:12:11Z","closed_at":"2026-09-17T12:12:11Z","assignee":{"login":"Cuiyus","id":42903451,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyOTAzNDUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42903451?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuiyus","html_url":"https://github.com/Cuiyus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuiyus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuiyus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuiyus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuiyus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuiyus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuiyus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuiyus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuiyus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuiyus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Affected Component\n\nDB\n\n### Current Behavior\n\nThe current name validation rules are very restrictive:\n\n```c++\nconst std::regex COLLECTION_NAME_REGEX(\"^[a-zA-Z0-9_-]{3,64}$\");\n\nconst std::regex FIELD_NAME_REGEX(\"^[a-zA-Z0-9_-]{1,32}$\");\n\nconst std::regex DOC_PK_REGEX(\"^[a-zA-Z0-9_!@#$%+=.-]{1,64}$\");\n```\n\nI don't see enough reasons to have such restrictions.\n\n<img width=\"695\" height=\"41\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/11361349-2448-40f3-badb-7f74f45b30d6\" />\n\n### Desired Improvement\n\nLifting or relaxing these restrictions, or making them configurable, for:\n\n- collection names\n- field names\n- document primary keys / IDs\n\nA more permissive validation rule, or a user-configurable validator, would make Zvec easier to adopt in heterogeneous environments.\n\nA more clear and user-friendly message indicating what is not allowed. \n\n### Impact\n\n- Better compatibility with existing datasets and external identifiers\n- Easier migration from other storage systems\n- Reduced need for application-side name rewriting or ID normalization\n- Less friction when integrating Zvec with multi-language tooling","closed_by":{"login":"JalinWang","id":20621784,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNjIxNzg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20621784?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JalinWang","html_url":"https://github.com/JalinWang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JalinWang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JalinWang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JalinWang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JalinWang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JalinWang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JalinWang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JalinWang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JalinWang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JalinWang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/rep